white-skill-tree-athletic-name = Athletic
white-skill-tree-athletic-desc = Develop your body by pushing the boundaries of what is available.

white-skill-tree-craftsmanship-name = Craftsmanship
white-skill-tree-craftsmanship-desc = Learn the arts and crafts that let you create and use all kinds of useful things.

white-skill-tree-electromancy-name = Electromancy
white-skill-tree-electromancy-desc = Discover the nature of deafening storms, winds, and thunderstorms.

white-skill-tree-healing-name = Vivification
white-skill-tree-healing-desc = Explore the ways in which magic affects living creatures.

white-skill-tree-hydrosophistry-name = Hydrosophy
white-skill-tree-hydrosophistry-desc = Master the magic of water and frost to create items from water and ice, and freeze enemies.

white-skill-tree-illusion-name = Illusion
white-skill-tree-illusion-desc = Explore the nature of light to create illusions, light sources and shadows.

white-skill-tree-metamagic-name = Metamagic
white-skill-tree-metamagic-desc = Explore ways to subtly manipulate magic to affect spells and items.
